<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grudge, rancour, ill-will</i>,
			more inveterate than <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.82
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				81
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσιν κ. αἰνὸν ἔθεσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.449
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσιν κότον αἰνὸν ἐνήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.449
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότον ἔνθετο θυμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόταν τις ἀμείλιχον καρδίᾳ κότον
					ἐνελάσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					8.9
				</span></i>
			: freq. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιμόνων κότῳ, Λοξίου
			κ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				635
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1211
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρὺς . . Ζηνὸς ἱκεσίου κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.</u>
					347
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θανόντος ἡ Δίκη πράσσει
				κότον</span> exacts <i>vengeance</i> for him, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				266.5
			</span></i>; never in <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, once in <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>(?), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				828
			</span></i> (lyr.).—Poet. and late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.51
			</span></i>.</div>
